================================================================================
PREAMBLE
================================================================================

Ultra Loader exists to preserve arcade games and to render pay-to-play
obsolete. It is, and will always be, free. There is no subscription, no
paywall, and no tier system. No game is ever locked behind a payment. All
research and development is returned to the community at no cost.

This license governs the open components of the Ultra Loader project: the
system board module source code and the firmware modules published by the
project. It is written to keep that work open, improvable, and owned by the
community that uses it, while protecting it from commercial exploitation and
from being turned into the very thing it was built to replace.

The spirit of this license is simple: study it, improve it, share your
improvements, and never charge anyone for access to any of it. If you build on
this work, bring your work back to the community.

================================================================================
1. DEFINITIONS
================================================================================

"The Project" means Ultra Loader, its developer (Sleyk), and its contributors.

"The Loader" means the Ultra Loader application and its proprietary components,
distributed in compiled form (for example, as a release download). The Loader
is NOT licensed under this document. See Section 2.

"Board Modules" means the system board module source code published in this
repository under the modules/ directory: original hook code, configuration
data, and board-specific compatibility logic written by the Project.

"Firmware Modules" means the per-game firmware files (.ufw) published by the
Project and distributed separately from this repository.

"Covered Work" means the Board Modules and Firmware Modules, together with any
modification, derivative, or contribution to them.

"You" means any individual or entity exercising rights under this license.

